## 2. Bronze Layer Schemas

{% for table in dms.bronze_schemas %}
### {{ table.name }} (Bronze)

{{ table.description }}

**Source**: {{ table.source_system }}.{{ table.source_table }} [HLD §{{ table.hld_ref }}]

```yaml
table: {{ table.name }}
layer: bronze
schema: {{ table.schema }}
source_table: {{ table.source_system }}.{{ table.source_table }}
partition_by: {{ table.partition_by }}
write_strategy: {{ table.write_strategy }}
columns:
{% for col in table.columns %}
  - name: {{ col.name }}
    type: {{ col.type }}
    nullable: {{ col.nullable }}
    source: {{ col.source }}
    description: {{ col.description }}
{% endfor %}
  # Metadata columns (added by pipeline)
  - name: _ingested_at
    type: TIMESTAMP
    nullable: false
    source: system
    description: Pipeline ingestion timestamp
  - name: _source_batch_id
    type: VARCHAR
    nullable: false
    source: system
    description: Pipeline run identifier
  - name: _source_file
    type: VARCHAR
    nullable: true
    source: system
    description: Source file path (file-based ingestion)
```

{% endfor %}

