## 3. Silver Layer Schemas

{% for table in dms.silver_schemas %}
### {{ table.name }} (Silver)

{{ table.description }}

**Business Purpose**: {{ table.business_purpose }} [HLD §{{ table.hld_ref }}]

```yaml
table: {{ table.name }}
layer: silver
schema: {{ table.schema }}
primary_key: {{ table.primary_key }}
partition_by: {{ table.partition_by }}
columns:
{% for col in table.columns %}
  - name: {{ col.name }}
    type: {{ col.type }}
    nullable: {{ col.nullable }}
    source: {{ col.source }}
    transform: "{{ col.transform }}"
    null_handling: "{{ col.null_handling }}"
    business_rule: {{ col.business_rule }}
    description: {{ col.description }}
{% endfor %}
foreign_keys:
{% for fk in table.foreign_keys %}
  - column: {{ fk.column }}
    references: {{ fk.references }}
{% endfor %}
```

{% endfor %}

