## 4. Gold Layer Schemas

{% for table in dms.gold_schemas %}
### {{ table.name }} (Gold)

{{ table.description }}

**Consumer**: {{ table.consumer }} [DRD §{{ table.drd_ref }}]

```yaml
table: {{ table.name }}
